// A memory line longer than its cap keeps the tail of that line.
// Short lines still keep the newest lines. The ranker is unchanged.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE tail ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG tail law

IMPULSE tail 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "tail" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
